      "content": "The Dobbs decision was a deliberate political maneuver by the Supreme Court to overturn decades of precedent and strip away a fundamental right to bodily autonomy.\nFraming it as a rollback of fundamental rights is far more accurate than calling it a mere legal change, as it fundamentally altered the status of reproductive freedom for millions of Americans.\nThis ruling prioritized political ideology over established constitutional protections, effectively reversing the progress made by Roe v. Wade.\nTherefore, describing it as an attack on fundamental rights captures the true nature of the decision's impact on civil liberties.",
      "source": "target",
